    "summary": "Integra Resources is a Canadian gold producer and developer — operating the Florida Canyon mine in Nevada (70-75K oz/year guidance) while advancing the DeLamar project, one of the largest undeveloped heap-leach gold-silver deposits in the Great Basin with a 4.8M oz AuEq resource. Trading at $3.01 with a debt-free balance sheet and $105.6M in cash, ITRG offers leveraged exposure to gold prices through both current production and a pipeline that could transform it into a 200-300K oz/year producer by 2029-2030. The Q1 2026 production update (April 23) confirmed a record 76,800 tpd mining rate, though ~3,000 oz were deferred due to leach pad flow issues.",
